OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1784994478
OL,3,CFirefighters remain at heathland blaze
OL,4,Cfor a third day.
OL,6,FFirefighters are continuing to monitor
OL,7,Fhotspots at a major gorse fire on the
OL,8,FIsle of Wight. Six crews are still at
OL,9,FHeadon Warren and are continuing to
OL,10,Fuse jets to tackle any flare ups.
OL,11,FThey're asking residents and visitors
OL,12,Fto continue to avoid the area.
OL,13,FHampshire And isle of Wight Fire &
OL,14,FRescue Service say they worked through
OL,15,Fthe night at the scene with the
OL,16,Fsupport of a crew from Avon FRS who
OL,17,Foperated a high volume pump that's
OL,18,Fbeing used to extract water from the
OL,19,Fsea.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/8
