OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1784994478
OL,3,CFirefighters remain at heathland blaze
OL,4,Cfor a third day.
OL,6,FThe fire was first reported shortly
OL,7,Fafter 9am on Thursday. It's burnt
OL,8,Fthrough 25 hectares (62 acres) of
OL,9,Fwoodland. The National Trust, which
OL,10,Fowns the land, said the fire was
OL,11,F"under control" but has significantly
OL,12,Fimpacted the landscape, which will
OL,13,Ftake time to recover. They went on to
OL,14,Fsay "We recognise that this incident
OL,15,Fwill be worrying for many people
OL,16,Facross the Isle of Wight. Our thoughts
OL,17,Fremain with everyone affected, and our
OL,18,Fpriority continues to be supporting
OL,19,Fthe emergency response and keeping
OL,20,Fpeople safe.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1784994478
OL,3,CFirefighters remain at heathland blaze
OL,4,Cfor a third day.
OL,6,FWe would like to express our sincere
OL,7,Fthanks to the firefighters who have
OL,8,Fworked tirelessly through extremely
OL,9,Fchallenging conditions, both yesterday
OL,10,Fand overnight, to tackle the blaze and
OL,11,Fhelp prevent it from spreading
OL,12,Ffurther. We are also incredibly
OL,13,Fgrateful to our tenants at Warren
OL,14,FFarm, neighbouring farmers, local
OL,15,Flandowners and our staff, who have
OL,16,Fworked alongside the emergency
OL,17,Fservices throughout the response.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1784994478
OL,3,CFirefighters remain at heathland blaze
OL,4,Cfor a third day.
OL,6,FHeadon Warren is a much-loved and
OL,7,Fnationally important landscape. At
OL,8,Fthis stage, however, it is too early
OL,9,Fto fully assess the impact of the fire
OL,10,Fon the site, its wildlife and
OL,11,Fhabitats. Once it is safe to do so,
OL,12,Four teams will begin assessing the
OL,13,Farea and understanding the extent of
OL,14,Fany damage.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1784994478
OL,3,CFirefighters remain at heathland blaze
OL,4,Cfor a third day.
OL,6,FWe understand how upsetting it is for
OL,7,Fpeople to see a fire of this scale
OL,8,Faffecting a place they care about so
OL,9,Fdeeply. We have been heartened by the
OL,10,Fmany messages of support received from
OL,11,Flocal residents, visitors and members
OL,12,Fof the wider community.
OL,14,FThe fire service continues to ask
OL,15,Fpeople to stay away from the area
OL,16,Fwhile crews remain at work. This will
OL,17,Fhelp ensure public safety and allow
OL,18,Femergency responders to carry out
OL,19,Ftheir work effectively.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1784994478
OL,3,CFirefighters remain at heathland blaze
OL,4,Cfor a third day.
OL,6,FThe conditions across the countryside
OL,7,Fremain extremely dry and the risk of
OL,8,Fwildfire remains exceptionally high.
OL,9,FIncidents like this demonstrate how
OL,10,Fquickly a fire can take hold and how
OL,11,Fdifficult it can be to bring under
OL,12,Fcontrol. We urge everyone enjoying the
OL,13,Foutdoors to help protect people,
OL,14,Fwildlife and landscapes by not
OL,15,Flighting barbecues or campfires,
OL,16,Fdisposing of cigarettes responsibly
OL,17,Fand taking litter home. Even items
OL,18,Fsuch as glass bottles can pose a fire
OL,19,Frisk during prolonged periods of hot,
OL,20,Fdry weather.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
