PN,38307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1784994478
OL,3,CFirefighters remain at heathland blaze
OL,4,Cfor a third day.
OL,6,FWe will continue to support the
OL,7,Femergency response and will provide
OL,8,Ffurther updates when more information
OL,9,Fbecomes available."
OL,11,FWatch: Drone footage captures fire
OL,12,Fspreading over the heathland in Headon
OL,13,FWarren.
OL,15,FThe fire service hasn't yet been able
OL,16,Fto confirm the cause of the fire.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
