OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1784994478
OL,3,CFirefighters remain at heathland blaze
OL,4,Cfor a third day.
OL,6,FOn Friday, a helicopter was brought in
OL,7,Fto water-drop inaccessible areas and
OL,8,Fadditional fire appliances and support
OL,9,Fhave been ferried to the island from
OL,10,Fthe mainland. WightLink Ferries says
OL,11,Fit helped transport nine fire engines
OL,12,Fto the island, while farmers in the
OL,13,Flocal area are understood to have used
OL,14,Ftheir tractors as fire breaks to help
OL,15,Fcrews.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/8
